{"items":[{"id":"1334544960025079808","title":"【郭树清澄清“国家垄断资本主义”论调：…","content":"<p>【郭树清澄清“国家垄断资本主义”论调：这是极大误解】中国的民营经济目前占到全部经济的60%，产业政策总体上与市场导向改革保持一致，国有企业总体上从政府得到的是负补贴，银行与国有企业之间财务完全独立，中国产品竞争力较强并非由于劳工权益受损。</p>","excerpt":"【郭树清澄清“国家垄断资本主义”论调：…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":11,"created":1610960313,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1334544960025079808"},{"id":"1334401452173803520","title":"美国算什么臭鱼烂虾？","content":"<p>美国算什么臭鱼烂虾？</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-151d8464b4eb5d83983ed91c72c13ec9_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"917\">","excerpt":"美国算什么臭鱼烂虾？","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":22,"created":1610926098,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1334401452173803520"},{"id":"1334137807132774400","title":"腾讯科技“黑白照”致敬Jack Ma","content":"<p>腾讯科技“黑白照”致敬Jack Ma</p><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-a7bcd4d2aaa554d76ab42406b6a51261_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"1374\">","excerpt":"腾讯科技“黑白照”致敬Jack Ma","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":15,"created":1610863240,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1334137807132774400"},{"id":"1334081265218134016","title":"这就是代价.....","content":"<p>这就是代价.....</p><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-4e21762cebb1dab86b4cb9e0badae92b_ms.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"946\"><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-9e67eefe8832356547f90d11c4b61353_ms.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"749\" height=\"866\">","excerpt":"这就是代价.....","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":10,"created":1610849759,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1334081265218134016"},{"id":"1333837290620391424","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-e6c7e657dcf7e204f3e1713d452e63ec_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1076\" height=\"1712\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":11,"created":1610791591,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1333837290620391424"},{"id":"1333423251369025536","title":"那啥，大家看到我回答或者是想法不需要有…","content":"<p>那啥，大家看到我回答或者是想法不需要有任何顾虑哈。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;有啥问题，尽管指出，有啥疑虑，尽管道明，事实错误，随时反对。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我发的任何东西都仅代表我个人想法和认知，并不一定对，只是把思考过程拿出来跟大家分享探讨一下.....&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我这人从小皮实，尤其脸皮贼厚，恰饭约稿公关啥的都自觉挨批。</p><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-a377627aca5987577b23961a0a860ea4_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"406\" height=\"201\">","excerpt":"那啥，大家看到我回答或者是想法不需要有…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":18,"created":1610692876,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1333423251369025536"},{"id":"1332947600630931456","title":"抖音在被特朗普禁止前禁言了特朗普","content":"<p>抖音在被特朗普禁止前禁言了特朗普。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;三十天河东，三十天河西。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;莫欺少年穷啊...</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-bc8590c392cd738c30a0b081cbf7b1fb_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1034\" height=\"229\">","excerpt":"抖音在被特朗普禁止前禁言了特朗普","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":2,"created":1610579472,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1332947600630931456"},{"id":"1332682147824889856","title":"这哥们是真有意思......","content":"<p>这哥们是真有意思......</p><p>［视频］</p>","excerpt":"这哥们是真有意思......","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":20,"created":1610516184,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1332682147824889856"},{"id":"1332626108567818240","title":"买房元素表... 我佛了....","content":"<p>买房元素表...&lt;br&gt;我佛了....</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-d190465804cddef5c5b282b7e9feaaef_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"798\">","excerpt":"买房元素表... 我佛了....","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":11,"created":1610502823,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1332626108567818240"},{"id":"1332413523390300160","title":"现在知乎也挺绝的","content":"<p>现在知乎也挺绝的。&lt;br&gt;外卖员自焚连是哪家的都不敢说了嘛？&lt;br&gt;对私人隐私一个态度，对企业形象又是一个态度。</p>","excerpt":"现在知乎也挺绝的","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":11,"created":1610452139,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1332413523390300160"}]}